    Add staged claim continuation and evidence-bound repair recovery

    Consume and seal one source batch per invocation, preserve earlier stage views, and require explicit recovery into a distinct linked run for missing or corrupt state. Route returned work to the source-defined evidence provider while retaining the returning reviewer. Clear a late-transfer issue only after its exact linked refund and later valid Finance resolution.

    Retain fresh linked native sources and four separate operational stages, including C20's partial refund/resolution demonstration. Preserve the original interview, graded run and financial results; actual C18 and missing definitions remain held.

    Validation: 211 tests passed; 54 focused regressions logged; independent reconciliation of all four snapshots and 804 expense-line occurrences found zero mismatches. Replay preserved all 57 files then present. No assessment resubmission performed.
